        "content": "## RSS Job Monitor\nRuns every 3 hours. Reads your Google Alerts RSS feeds and pharma job-portal\nRSS feeds, then sends each item to the Pharma Job Processing Engine\n(which filters, scores, dedups, and stores matches).\n\nSETUP: edit the \"Google Alert Feeds\" and \"Pharma Portal Feeds\" Code nodes\nand replace the REPLACE_WITH_* placeholder URLs with your real feed URLs."
      }
